cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TreadOps in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TreadOps: casing circularity with YOLO26, governed MLOps and a guarded LangGraph copilot"
abstract: >-
  TreadOps turns a phone photo of a tyre into a casing-intake decision for a retreading operation (retread intake,
  expert inspection or material recovery). An Ultralytics YOLO26 classifier triages the photo with every
  preprocessing stage recorded, an inspector gives final clearance, and a ledger estimates the material and CO2e kept
  in use from inspector-verified retreads only. It includes a DVC + MLflow release loop with gated promotion,
  rollback, drift monitoring and replay, and a LangGraph copilot with guardrails and LLMOps tracing.
